This is a simple S3 application to calculate a paycheck with
overtime. It will also show the average pay per hour with
overtime.

It is an Opa file and can be loaded to the system screen by
pressing Psion<I> to install. It can also be run as an Opo
by just renaming it Pay.opo and copy it to any \opo directory.


